{%- doc -%}
  Texts for the pp-size-guide popup in the storefront language (it, de, es,
  pl, else en). Prints them joined by "|~|" in this fixed order: link, close,
  size, chest, waist, hips, shoe, foot, sub_women, sub_men, sub_shoes, fit,
  fit_shoes, exchange, how, how_chest, how_waist, how_hips, how_foot, note,
  sub_garment, fit_garment, how_garment, length, sleeve, shoulder, inseam,
  pants_length.

  @param {string} lang - Two-letter storefront language
  @param {string} gender - "women" or "men"
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- case lang -%}
