    How to measure|~|
    <strong>Bust / chest:</strong> at the fullest point, tape level under the armpits.|~|
    <strong>Waist:</strong> at the narrowest point, just above the belly button.|~|
    <strong>Hips:</strong> at the fullest point of the seat, feet together.|~|
    <strong>Foot:</strong> stand with your heel against a wall on a sheet of paper and measure from heel to longest toe.|~|
    Guide values, may vary by 1–2 cm (about 1/2 in).|~|
    Garment measurements|~|
    These are the garment’s own measurements, not body measurements. Compare them with a similar item that fits you well.|~|
    <strong>How to compare:</strong> lay a similar item that fits you well flat. Chest: armpit to armpit × 2. Length: from the highest point of the shoulder to the hem. Sleeve: from the shoulder seam to the cuff.|~|
